    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to my game purchase store!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sudden power struggle has plunged the once-peaceful kingdom into chaos. While the King was out hunting, the Prime Minister conspired with traitors and crowned the young nephew as the new ruler. But even with only 18 loyal followers by his side, the true King refuses to surrender. He vows to fight his way back to the castle, overthrow the usurper, and reclaim his rightful throne!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this unique strategic combat adventure! You\u2019ll journey through 7 distinct and challenging scenarios, facing off against dozens of enemy types. Your quest begins in the mysterious Crown Forest, where you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your troop formations and tactical strategies before each battle. As the fight unfolds, hordes of monsters with unique environmental traits will rush in from all directions, testing your skills. Use a wide array of skills and equipment to intervene in real-time and ensure victory. After each round, you\u2019ll have the chance to obtain random gear and rare relics to strengthen your forces. Don\u2019t forget to visit the shop to recruit more followers and build an army that\u2019s both massive and elite. Only the wisest and bravest commanders can march from the forest to the castle and complete this epic mission of revenge and restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join now and begin your legendary journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players command troops to face waves of incoming enemies. Before battles, they can change the formation of their forces according to the scenario and equip soldiers with various gear, which strengthens the soldiers. Mages, in particular, can cast different spells by equipping specific items\u2014such as launching light spears, summoning meteorites, opening portals, or triggering lightning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, players can select preferred equipment, visit the shop to purchase supplies, and reinforce their troops. Occasionally, players will obtain precious relics that provide global buffs or summon magic during combat to rescue their forces in critical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/31bc43d84ffcc369c759a5e163e82700.poster.avif?t=1747237541\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/31bc43d84ffcc369c759a5e163e82700.webm?t=1747237541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/31bc43d84ffcc369c759a5e163e82700.mp4?t=1747237541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/7d7b6c8de5c9048cb104a42b322e0874.poster.avif?t=1747237541\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/7d7b6c8de5c9048cb104a42b322e0874.webm?t=1747237541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373460/extras/7d7b6c8de5c9048cb104a42b322e0874.mp4?t=1747237541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to my game purchase store!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sudden power struggle has plunged the once-peaceful kingdom into chaos. While the King was out hunting, the Prime Minister conspired with traitors and crowned the young nephew as the new ruler. But even with only 18 loyal followers by his side, the true King refuses to surrender. He vows to fight his way back to the castle, overthrow the usurper, and reclaim his rightful throne!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this unique strategic combat adventure! You\u2019ll journey through 7 distinct and challenging scenarios, facing off against dozens of enemy types. Your quest begins in the mysterious Crown Forest, where you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your troop formations and tactical strategies before each battle. As the fight unfolds, hordes of monsters with unique environmental traits will rush in from all directions, testing your skills. Use a wide array of skills and equipment to intervene in real-time and ensure victory. After each round, you\u2019ll have the chance to obtain random gear and rare relics to strengthen your forces. Don\u2019t forget to visit the shop to recruit more followers and build an army that\u2019s both massive and elite. Only the wisest and bravest commanders can march from the forest to the castle and complete this epic mission of revenge and restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join now and begin your legendary journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players command troops to face waves of incoming enemies. Before battles, they can change the formation of their forces according to the scenario and equip soldiers with various gear, which strengthens the soldiers. Mages, in particular, can cast different spells by equipping specific items\u2014such as launching light spears, summoning meteori